631:      * Finds all figs on the diagrams for some project member,
632:      * including the figs containing the member (so for some
633:      * operation, the containing figclass is returned).
634:      *
635:      * @param member The member we are looking for.
636:      *              This can be a model element object but also another object.
637:      * @return Collection The collection with the figs.
638:      */
639:     public Collection findFigsForMember(Object member) {
640:         Collection figs = new ArrayList();
641:         Iterator it = diagrams.iterator();
642:         while (it.hasNext()) {
643:             ArgoDiagram diagram = (ArgoDiagram) it.next();
644:             Object fig = diagram.getContainingFig(member);
645:             if (fig != null) {
646:                 figs.add(fig);
