896:      * node with index endindex. An activation means in this context
897:      * that the starting and ending node will be an activation node
898:      * after a call to this method.  The starting node is designated
899:      * via the start property that's a starting node. The same is true
900:      * for the ending node via the end property.<p>
901:      *
902:      * @param startIndex int
903:      * @param endIndex int
